  partName: Upper Mounting Bolt
  description: The Upper Mounting Bolt is a tiny, complex bolt located at the top-center-center
    of the engine, playing a vital role in securing the engine's upper mount and
    maintaining its position. Constructed from Material.001, this bolt withstands
    significant stress and vibration, ensuring the engine's stability and balance.
    Interestingly, its position at the top-center-center of the engine allows it
    to work in conjunction with the lower mounting bolt, providing a secure and balanced
    connection for the engine's mounts.
